Vendored software: dsh-mobile transport gateway
==============================================================================

This product includes software from the dsh-mobile project
(https://github.com/saya-ch/dsh-mobile), version 0.6.12, commit
0efceeb9c5698e854e9d1e227a93bf393e69effa, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (the same licence text is kept in plugin/LICENSE).

Vendored sources: plugin/vendor/gateway/ (transport modules and the stub
boundaries), with the build entry plugin/vendor/entry.js and stubs in
plugin/vendor/_stubs.js.
Built artifact: plugin/lib/gateway-bundle.js.
Local modifications are recorded file by file in
plugin/vendor/gateway/VENDORED.md (this record is the "changes" notice required
by Apache-2.0 section 4(b)); attribution to the original authors is kept there.
Files copied without modification: private-file.ts, exec-file.ts, ip.ts,
network.ts, local-admin-host.ts, browser-auth-cookies.ts, auth-pages.ts,
auth-failure-log.ts and http-cache.ts; config.ts, gateway.ts, access.ts,
storage.ts, version.ts and http-security.ts carry our changes.

